$ docker run --rm --name shorty-api-dup -p 8080:8080 --network shorty-net \
    shorty:dev /out/shorty serve
docker: Error response from daemon: failed to set up container networking: driver failed programming external connectivity on endpoint shorty-api-dup (089f7ea8de3ea48996b3cf7c04b4e6f929d26a3cc9759fc3ae4025fab226ce48): Bind for 127.0.0.1:8080 failed: port is already allocated

